Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打败了蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟七人帮的激战 总算告一个段落的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到七人帮的 四魂之玉碎片的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新生奈落终于现身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:31.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:36.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:40.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:45.06,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:57.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:02.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:06.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:10.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:15.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:18.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:22.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:26.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:33.14,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:38.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:45.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:48.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 我接住你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:02:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:01.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.30,0:03:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:16.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第123话 新生的奈落出现于黑暗尽处
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:21.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:33.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你这个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛跑到这么危险的地方来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是交代过你 要你在外面等我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家真的…很担心你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛担这个心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼 你果然没有照顾好…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘦皮狼那个笨蛋到哪去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:14.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙已经被肉墙吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说瘦皮狼…被吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说 你最好马上离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 什么怪东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 快离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个声音是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕的一股妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:53.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定和奈落有很大关系…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:04:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动不了了吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你…你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然能找到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来想赞许你一番的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就要变成我奈落的五脏六腑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:41.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是该结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么结束 你别作梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要结束是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也得等我割断你的喉咙再说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们一定要取了你的那条命
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:12.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好烫…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:14.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是…强酸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 开始溶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:21.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:26.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道还不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在整座白灵山 全都是我奈落的身体了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.00,0:06:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.63,0:06:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一个个都在我身体里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座肉墙真的是奈落的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 难道我们跟钢牙一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要被奈落吃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太高估自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还没有被吃掉的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是没用的小妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:17.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在说我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有像犬夜叉这种半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个人类就更别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会减损我奈落的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类的愚蠢 简直是叫我作呕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像蛮骨这样的邪魔歪道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了帮兄弟们报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也敢闯进这个禁地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟犬夜叉你搏斗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把七块碎片给了七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦这些碎片都得手后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.01,0:08:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不管什么报仇不报仇的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早早逃之夭夭不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏这小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做人类的这种生物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你这臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:08:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他真的像你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是邪魔歪道没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮所有兄弟们 一个个都战死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我要替他们讨回公道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让你更容易取得四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我故意用这双手跟你对打呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过就算如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是比你正直几百倍以上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:32.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而奈落你居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这可恶至极的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.07,0:09:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛发那么大火呢 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮骨可是先死在你手中的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:50.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不客气的收下了这些四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片已经合而为一了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于现身了吗 奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股妖气…一定错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您在跟我说话吗 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 已经现身了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了杀生丸少爷之外
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的妖气 我还是头一次见识到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:09.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样跟下去 说不定我就因此送命了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你一战成功
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:22.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 马上就会结束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道不用再等了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 已经不在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片全都聚集了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:28.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落的新生肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些对我恨之入骨的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,费尽千辛万苦总算找到我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是现在却连我的一根指头都碰不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 也太让我们扫兴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你处心积虑地躲在这圣地里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.76,0:14:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在猜 你是会变成多厉害的妖怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖气 不知比以前强多少倍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:19.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:22.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分明是奈落又在装神弄鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他那点功力 只会越变越差而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:36.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真爱开玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:55.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然徒手也敢跟我奈落斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:58.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:15:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你那么想死的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本少爷就将你碎尸万段
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 乖乖的受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.98,0:15:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤被打回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.61,0:15:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤竟然停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:55.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 快躲到飞来骨后面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:01.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:07.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那个什么风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全被我的妖气控制住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:15.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你中了奈落的计
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发动什么风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:20.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:22.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤会在这里不断地徘徊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:32.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到你们全都被打成肉酱为止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到自己发动的风之伤会害死你的伙伴们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:56.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白灵山里面到处弥漫着妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:05.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是奈落的分身 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怀里抱的是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是桔梗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱来 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:31.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗轮不到你来收拾她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来这家伙会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你到底又放走了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让这阵风…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:15.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要想办法让这阵风停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉他们马上会死在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我也已经得到新的肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下最后一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落 你想逃走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快追 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去追奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了 可是你怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这阵风真的是奈落的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定我有办法让它停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况 刚刚我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的脚底 有其他两块四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有两块
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是瘦皮狼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙他是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心会被奈落化为他身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.74,0:19:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要救他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还得看他是不是还活着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然从风之伤里飞了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:58.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股妖气是绕着奈落转动的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就瞄准奈落这个坏蛋射箭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:04.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看箭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候还有心情关心朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在看不下去你们的愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:57.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.91,0:21:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这么关心朋友的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山要崩塌了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 是瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:21.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就特别开恩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们跟好友们一起长眠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:21:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就去见你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:13.21,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷偷亲你一下 装作若无其事的样子{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:18.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样调皮 是不是像个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:24.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已习惯 被你说是娇嗔无理
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:31.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 「喜欢你」 这三个字却始终说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:34.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}My Sweet Emotion{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.57,0:22:45.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对着镜子 多看一次 看看自己的微笑{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:58.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果想飞奔出去追求刺激就得挺起胸膛向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.26,0:23:08.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大胆放手去做 直到满意为止{\fad(0,800)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.04,0:23:18.64,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}偷偷亲你一下 装作若无其事的样子{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:24.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样调皮 是不是像个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.29,0:23:30.32,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早已习惯 被你说是娇嗔无理
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:36.56,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 「喜欢你」 这三个字却始终说不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:39.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}My Sweet Emotion{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.35,0:23:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用担心 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.62,0:23:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会把瘦皮狼救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉去救钢牙 就在短短的时间里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:23:58.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落已经出现在桔梗的面前了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.39,0:23:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真正的目的到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.53,0:24:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这块崩裂的地底下 已经布满了我的瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种假肉体
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是撑不了多久的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.53,0:24:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗 这里就是你的坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.84,0:24:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 心爱的桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着她死却没办法救她的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.34,0:24:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 是你
